SchemeGuard Thesis Report Bundle
================================

Main file: Final_Thesis_All.tex
Compiler: pdfLaTeX on Overleaf

The report source uses a neutral standard LaTeX report layout. It does not use
the NIT Agartala thesis class or any HireMate screenshots, author details or
branding. The SchemeGuard report name is used throughout.

Folder map
----------
source/report_content.py   Editable report narrative and structure
source/create_assets.py    Rebuild the SchemeGuard PNG/SVG illustrations
build_overleaf.py          Generate Final_Thesis_All.tex in place
submission.json            Editable, confirmed front-matter metadata
bib/mybib.bib              Editable BibTeX references
images/                    SchemeGuard artwork and interface figures
pic1.png                   Document-to-policy workflow figure
schemeguardthesis.cls      Optional neutral report class
*.sty                      Reusable LaTeX support packages with notices

Upload the complete folder to Overleaf, then set Final_Thesis_All.tex as the
main document. The report source includes vector fallbacks for key figures.
See README.md for the full file inventory, update commands and evidence limits.
